    <title>03.摆脱出行焦虑 拥抱惊喜普吉之旅</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66d95ae2bfd7110df46d328c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66d95ae2bfd7110df46d328c</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 05 Sep 2024 13:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🌟听姐摆 · 第3期：旅行、亲子、出行焦虑、旅行准备、普吉岛</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>30+的Summer，热爱自由的旅行达人，以个人旅行的感受分享世界各地的旅行奇遇。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>40+的Y姐（歪姐），出行焦虑的单亲妈妈，以母亲的刚柔并济带着儿子踏遍千山万水，分享亲子旅行的点滴感悟。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>双视角交融：围绕旅行焦虑开展对话，从旅行的焦虑到惊喜，从安全准备到避坑建议，共同探索旅行中的多彩世界</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🕒 节目时间轴，精彩不等待：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="41">00:41</a> 🌟Y姐揭秘：泰国旅行决策背后，那些不为人知的焦虑与释然 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="488">08:08</a> 🎉旅行逆袭记！意外惊喜如何秒杀出行前所有小焦虑 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="602">10:02</a> 🌊Y姐母子海趣时光：出海不晕船，欢乐满载归 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="734">12:14</a> 🤿Summer浮潜跳水初体验：从恐惧边缘到尝试之后的感悟-有些恐惧真的很难克服 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1095">18:15</a> 💧水质疑云？泰国水域亲测，打消你的水质顾虑 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1287">21:27</a> 🛡️安全卫生大揭秘：原来我们的身体是超级旅行小能手</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1621">27:01</a> 🧳行李奇遇记：旅行险是很有必要的，教你如何从容应对行李延误 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2013">33:33</a> 🏨亲子天堂！普吉岛万怡酒店，亲子游的不二之选 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2214">36:54</a> 🌅绝美落日，苏林酒店美到让你哭泣，体验升级再升级 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2423">40:23</a> 🔒旅行安全小贴士：重要证件随身带，安全出行无烦恼 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2487">41:27</a> 👶Y姐亲授：普吉岛亲子游避雷全攻略，带娃出游更省心 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2665">44:25</a> 👻泰国奇遇夜：朋友的故事，当旅行遇上灵异，胆小勿入！ &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2793">46:33</a> 🌍预告来袭！Summer格鲁吉亚行，下一站精彩敬请期待 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2852">47:32</a> 💡旅行哲学：别让未来忧虑绊住脚，准备充分，尽享当下美好 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2874">47:54</a> 🎶完美落幕：希望这份指南能成为你的旅行小助手</span></p><span></span><p><span>📷Y姐和Summer的落日PK照片，大家来评评理，谁赢啦，哈哈哈哈哈！</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌅泰国普吉岛苏林酒店绝美落日</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuVCdcHHeu9LISo9VslXJH6_1wvV.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>🌅巴厘岛Ayana酒店rock bar最美落日</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu55_Bui13Tuo4cSsox3KhoddDVs.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>🎶 背景音乐：Jailcell Mind - Hayley Sales</span></p><span></span><p><span>💌 互动邀约：如果你有有趣好玩的旅行故事，想分享？私信或邮件我们，一起创造更多精彩</span></p><span></span><p><span>📧 联系邮箱：</span><a href="mailto:3384053@qq.com"><span>3384053@qq.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
