    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🌟</span><strong><span>听姐摆 · 第1期：相亲、交友、情感、生活</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>30+的Summer，生活热爱者，E型人格的代表。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>40+的Y姐，内敛I型人格，深思熟虑的智者。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>双视角碰撞：E与I的火花，相亲联谊的趣谈。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🕒 </span><strong><span>节目时间轴，精彩不等待：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="28">00:28</a> 我们的播客，你的生活调味剂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="55">00:55</a> 集体相亲现场直击，两位姐姐的感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="559">09:19</a> 社交活动背后，隐藏的认识新朋友的秘诀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="613">10:13</a> 交友软件，现代爱情的双刃剑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="667">11:07</a> 软件交友的苦涩，你我都懂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="983">16:23</a> 社交的动力，源自内心的渴望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1119">18:39</a> 网络虚实，交友之道，不以结婚为唯一目的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1363">22:43</a> 恋爱的意义，自我发现的旅程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1533">25:33</a> 30岁，婚姻观的转变，成熟的标志</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1744">29:04</a> 也要跟上现在的流行，谈一谈姐弟恋呀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1888">31:28</a> 人生苦短，爱情长存，享受每一刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2107">35:07</a> 别给自己设限，自信最美，每个阶段都值得更好的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2361">39:21</a> 咱们第一期就摆到这吧，期待与你的下一次相遇。七夕节快乐，愿你收获幸福与甜蜜！</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎶 </span><strong><span>背景音乐</span></strong><span>：《complex》- 周智羽</span></p><span></span><p><span>💌 </span><strong><span>互动邀约</span></strong><span>：有故事，想分享？私信或邮件我们，一起创造更多精彩</span></p><span></span><p><span>📧 </span><strong><span>联系邮箱</span></strong><span>：